Patches to @gespenst/core, applied by bun (package.json "patchedDependencies").
Bun ignores everything above the first "diff --git" line, so keep notes here.
`bun patch` regenerates this file when committing, so copy this header back afterwards.

1. resize() and fit(): keep the grid while the host measures 0x0
   Bug: a hidden workspace's terminal falls back to 80x24, and the PTY resize makes TUIs
   like Pi redraw their whole history.
   Can be dropped once switching to another workspace and back leaves tmux's window size
   unchanged.

2. sendText(): send text through the backend again, as 0.1.1 did
   Bug: 0.2.0 emits text input (IME commits, non-ASCII characters, mobile keyboards)
   immediately, while keys still go through the worker, so text overtakes keys typed
   before it ("abc 日本語" arrives as "日本語abc").
   Can be dropped once typing "abc 日本語 def" quickly into a Shell terminal arrives in order.

